OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds of jobs to be cut across
OL,4,Athree hospitals
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 260 jobs are set to be cut
OL,7,Facross three West Yorkshire hospitals.
OL,9,FThe Mid Yorkshire Teaching NHS Trust,
OL,10,Fwhich runs Pinderfields Hospital in
OL,11,FWakefield, as well as Pontefract and
OL,12,FDewsbury hospitals, said the cuts would
OL,13,Fbe met through a voluntary redundancy
OL,14,Fscheme.
OL,16,FThe job losses, which were first
OL,17,Freported by the Wakefield Express, were
OL,18,Fpart of a drive to save #57m this
OL,19,Ffinancial year, the trust said.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
